  "solution": "We substitute the options in the given figure and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\nOption 1) −, +, ÷, ×, =, +\n\n32 - 4 + __**12 ÷ 4**__ × 6 = 5 + 1\n\n32 - 4 + __**3**____** ×**____** 6**__ = 5 + 1\n\n__**32**__ - 4 __**+ 18**__ = __**5 + 1\n\n50 - 4**__ = 6 \n\n46 ≠ 6\n\nOption 2) −, +, ÷, =, ×, +\n​32 - 4 + __**12 ÷ 4**__ = 6 × 5 + 1\n\n32 - 4 + 3 = __**6 **____**×**____** 5**__ + 1\n\n__**32**__ - 4 __**+ 3**__ = __**30**____** +**____** 1\n\n35 - 4**__ = 31\n\n31 = 31\n\nOption 3) +, −, ÷, ×, =, +\n​32 + 4 - __**12 ÷ 4**__ × 6 = 5 + 1\n\n32 + 4 - __**3**____** ×**____** 6**__ = 5 + 1\n\n__**32 +**____** 4**__ - 18 = __**5 + 1\n\n36 - 18**__ = 6\n\n18 ≠ 6\n\nOption 4) −, +, ×, =, ÷, +\n​32 - 4 + 12 × 4 = __**6 ÷ 5**__ + 1\n\n32 - 4 + __**12 **____**×**____** 4**__ = 1.2 + 1\n\n__**32**__ - 4 __**+ 48**__ = __**1.2**____** +**____** 1\n\n80 - 4**__ = 2.2\n\n76 ≠ 2.2\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**option (2)\".**\n\n84:T",
